# Fedora COPR Repositories & Flathub Configuration
#
# Primary Hyprland stack COPR. solopasha/hyprland (the historically
# recommended repo) is abandoned; lionheartp/Hyprland is the actively
# maintained fork the Omarchy-on-Fedora ecosystem has standardized on.
# Covers: hyprland, hyprland-uwsm, hyprpaper, hyprlock, hypridle,
#         hyprpicker, hyprsunset, xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland,
#         quickshell, uwsm, hyprland-guiutils
lionheartp/Hyprland

# Ghostty Terminal — REQUIRED: ghostty is in the base manifest and is NOT
# packaged in official Fedora. Verified building for fedora-44 x86_64.
scottames/ghostty

# Fallback if lionheartp ever disappears: nett00n/hyprland (automated,
# aarch64 too) and errornointernet/quickshell (quickshell only).
# Note nett00n lacks hyprpicker and the hyprland-uwsm subpackage.

# Flathub Repository URL for Desktop Flatpak Apps
FLATHUB_URL=https://dl.flathub.org/repo/flathub.flatpakrepo
